From: Bubun Das <bubundas17@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:27:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] System server: extend banking compat with Build field
 spoof

Paytm and similar apps also read zygote-baked Build.IS_DEBUGGABLE /
TAGS after the Settings and USB sticky spoofs. Apply matching Build
rewrites in-process when the banking_compatibility preset is enabled.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 core/java/android/app/ActivityThread.java     |   4 +
 .../app/BankingCompatibilitySpoof.java        | 103 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../wm/sandbox/SettingsSpoofController.java   |   8 ++
 3 files changed, 115 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/java/android/app/BankingCompatibilitySpoof.java

diff --git a/core/java/android/app/ActivityThread.java b/core/java/android/app/ActivityThread.java
index 0164381827cb..be39d136c840 100644
--- a/core/java/android/app/ActivityThread.java
+++ b/core/java/android/app/ActivityThread.java
@@ -8196,6 +8196,10 @@ public final class ActivityThread extends ClientTransactionHandler
 
         GamePropsSpoofService.getInstance().spoofForPackage(data.appInfo.packageName);
 
+        // Banking preset: rewrite zygote-baked Build debug/signing fields before
+        // application code (e.g. Paytm) inspects them.
+        BankingCompatibilitySpoof.applyForPackage(data.appInfo.packageName);
+
         PlayIntegritySpoofService pifService = PlayIntegritySpoofService.getInstance();
         if (pifService.shouldSpoof(data.processName)) {
             pifService.spoofBuildFields(data.processName);
diff --git a/core/java/android/app/BankingCompatibilitySpoof.java b/core/java/android/app/BankingCompatibilitySpoof.java
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..7968fe9c953c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/java/android/app/BankingCompatibilitySpoof.java
@@ -0,0 +1,103 @@
